            <p><subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">The</del> <add place="above" seq="2"><del rend="overstrike">and</del> the</add></subst> intellectual and emotional nature, <del rend="overstrike"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one or two characters" resp="#bb"/></del> <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">was</del> <add place="above" rend="unmarked" seq="4">would</add> <del rend="overstrike" seq="3"><add seq="2">were</add></del></subst> <del rend="overstrike"><add place="above"><unclear reason="illegible" cert="medium" resp="#tj">then</unclear></add></del> <add place="above">be</add> at their best; <del rend="overstrike">and highest</del> Deaths were always easier <subst rend="overwrite"><add>;</add><del rend="overstrike">&#8212;</del></subst> and even 
                <milestone unit="glued"/> <del rend="overstrike">and</del> <del rend="overstrike"><subst rend="overwrite"><del>E</del><add>e</add></subst>ven</del> medicines would have more effect when given then.</p>
            <p>The <add place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a001">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" xml:id="a001">same influences</add> same hour <del rend="overstrike">&#38; the same influences</del> after <del rend="overstrike">one <gap reason="illegible" extent="three or four characters" resp="#bb"/></del> great battles.  I had once or twice <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">such</del> <add place="above" seq="2">the</add></subst> experience<del rend="overstrike">s</del> <add place="above" rend="unmarked">of it</add> on the field covered with <subst><del rend="overstrike" seq="1"><gap reason="illegible" extent="one word"/></del> <add place="above" seq="2">dead</add></subst>
            </p>
